   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "द्विग्रहयोगाध्याय:",
   "bbox": [
    827,
    616,
    1138,
    674
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "<b>Combination of Planets</b>",
   "bbox": [
    504,
    682,
    1457,
    779
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Sun with other Planets",
   "bbox": [
    364,
    925,
    976,
    984
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "तिग्मांशुर्जनयत्यथेन्दुसहितो यन्त्राश्मकारं नरं",
   "bbox": [
    435,
    1009,
    1064,
    1081
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "भौमेनाघरतं बुधेन निपुणं धीकीर्तिसौख्यान्वितम् ।",
   "bbox": [
    435,
    1069,
    1117,
    1146
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "क्रूरं वाक्पतिनान्यकार्यनिरतं शुक्रेण रङ्गायुधै-",
   "bbox": [
    430,
    1131,
    1069,
    1217
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "र्लब्धस्वं रविजेन धातुकुशलं भाण्डप्रकारेषु वा।। 1 ।।",
   "bbox": [
    428,
    1203,
    1220,
    1285
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Sun with Moon makes a person employ himself in machine",
   "bbox": [
    427,
    1299,
    1573,
    1378
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "work or in the sale etc of utensils. If it is with Mars the man",
   "bbox": [
    347,
    1350,
    1570,
    1426
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "engages in crime. If with Mercury he is efficient in every way",
   "bbox": [
    346,
    1400,
    1570,
    1484
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "and also intelligent, famous and happy. If it is with Jupiter he",
   "bbox": [
    345,
    1452,
    1567,
    1536
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "is of a fierce temperament and always engaged in the service",
   "bbox": [
    341,
    1505,
    1566,
    1588
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "of others. If it is with Venus the man is engaged in wrestling",
   "bbox": [
    340,
    1557,
    1566,
    1642
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "or as a dealer in weapons. If it is with Saturn the man deals in",
   "bbox": [
    339,
    1607,
    1561,
    1697
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "metals and utensils etc.",
   "bbox": [
    339,
    1665,
    816,
    1716
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Moon with other Planets",
   "bbox": [
    334,
    1768,
    989,
    1826
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "कूटस्त्र्यासवकुम्भपण्यमशिवं मातुः सवक्रः शशी",
   "bbox": [
    407,
    1852,
    1099,
    1921
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "सज्ञ: प्रश्रितवाक्यमर्थनिपुणं सौभाग्यकोर्त्यान्वितम्।",
   "bbox": [
    405,
    1912,
    1113,
    1989
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "विक्रान्तं कुलमुख्यमस्थिरमतिं वित्तेश्वरं साङ्गिरा",
   "bbox": [
    402,
    1979,
    1089,
    2053
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "वस्त्राणां ससित: क्रियादिकुशलं सार्कि: पुनर्भूसुतम् ।। 2 ।।",
   "bbox": [
    400,
    2045,
    1254,
    2126
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "If Moon is with Mars, the native engages in highly diplo-",
   "bbox": [
    395,
    2140,
    1543,
    2218
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "matic actions and in selling wine. This combination is not",
   "bbox": [
    317,
    2188,
    1543,
    2271
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "conducive to the long life of his mother. If it is with Mercury",
   "bbox": [
    317,
    2241,
    1540,
    2323
   ]
  }
 ]
}